    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/340000816",
    "space": {
      "key": "SFCC",
      "name": "Adobe SFCC"
    },
    "version": 2,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "Overview\n--------\n\nPrice books must be correctly configured and activated for prices to display on the storefront. Zimmermann operates multiple currencies across seven storefronts — each site requires its own correctly assigned price books. Misconfiguration here means prices silently fail to render.\n\n**📎 Salesforce Reference:** [Price Books — Trailhead Launch Readiness](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/b2c-solution-functional-launch-readiness/b2c-review-business-manager)  \n**📎 Salesforce Docs:** [Managing Price Books in Business Manager](https://documentation.b2c.commercecloud.salesforce.com/DOC2/topic/com.demandware.dochelp/Pricing/PriceBooks.html)\n\n**⚠️ Risk note:** Price book replication schedules from staging to production are often unconfigured by departing architects. Verify schedules exist and are active.\n\n---\n\nChecklist\n---------\n\n### Global Price Book Requirements\n\nincompleteAt least one price book exists in the system\nincompleteA list price book exists (e.g. `aud-list-prices`, `gbp-list-prices`)\nincompleteA sale price book exists linked to the list price book\nincompleteSale prices are based on (reference) the list prices — not standalone values\nincompleteStrikethrough / was-is pricing displays correctly on the storefront\n\n### Per-Site Price Book Assignment (Merchant Tools → Products & Catalogs → Price Books)\n\nincompleteAU — AUD list price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteAU — AUD sale price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteUK — GBP list price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteUK — GBP sale price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteUS Domestic — USD list price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteUS Domestic — USD sale price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteUS Intl — USD/relevant currency price book assigned and **active** (Global-e handles currency conversion but base prices must exist)\nincompleteEU Domestic — EUR list price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteEU Domestic — EUR sale price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteEU Intl — EUR price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteME — relevant currency price book assigned and **active**\n\n### Replication & Scheduling\n\nincompletePrice book import job is scheduled on staging (recommended: every hour)\nincompletePrice book data replication from staging to production is scheduled\nincompleteReplication schedule is confirmed active in BM Administration → Replication\n\n### Sale Day Verification\n\nincompleteScheduled pricing via price books is tested (prices effective from a specified date/time)\nincompleteSale price books activate at the correct time per timezone per storefront\nincompletePrice book preview by date is working in BM\n\n\n---\n\nNotes / Findings\n----------------\n\n*Record gaps, decisions, and owner for remediation here.*\n\n| Finding | Severity | Owner | Resolved |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  |  |  |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "emoji": "1f4b2",
    "page_width": "full-width"
  }
}"}

