pleteEU Domestic — EUR sale price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteEU Intl — EUR price book assigned and **active**\nincompleteME — relevant currency price book assigned and **active**\n\n### Replication & Scheduling\n\nincompletePrice book import job is scheduled on staging (recommended: every hour)\nincompletePrice book data replication from staging to production is scheduled\nincompleteReplication schedule is confirmed active in BM Administration → Replication\n\n### Sale Day Verification\n\nincompleteScheduled pricing via price books is tested (prices effective from a specified date/time)\nincompleteSale price books activate at the correct time per timezone per storefront\nincompletePrice book preview by date is working in BM\n\n\n---\n\nNotes / Findings\n----------------\n\n*Record gaps, decisions, and owner for remediation here.*\n\n| Finding | Severity | Owner | Resolved |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  |  |  |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "emoji": "1f4b2",
    "page_width": "full-width"
  }
}"}

